<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_closest__point_8hpp">glm/gtx/closest_point.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Find the point on a straight line which is the closet of a point.</para>
</section>
